WEBVTT

00:00.310 --> 00:03.890
<b>Episode 2: In Love with Him</b>

00:35.840 --> 00:38.180
Morning, beautiful.

00:56.440 --> 00:58.340
<i>Looks: A+!</i>

00:57.570 --> 00:58.820
<b>Looks A+</b>

00:59.880 --> 01:01.660
<i>Body: A+!</i>

01:00.370 --> 01:01.660
<b>Body A+</b>

01:03.240 --> 01:05.460
<i>Personality: A+!</i>

01:04.250 --> 01:05.460
<b>Personality A+
(On the outside)</b>

01:06.040 --> 01:09.620
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

01:10.210 --> 01:13.180
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

01:13.710 --> 01:15.220
<i>It's been a year since I moved to Tokyo.</i>

01:19.970 --> 01:23.600
<i>And in my high school life, 
it's me for the win!</i>

01:50.420 --> 01:50.840
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:50.420 --> 01:50.840
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:51.090 --> 01:51.840
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:51.090 --> 01:51.840
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:51.090 --> 01:51.840
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:51.090 --> 01:51.840
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

02:47.270 --> 02:54.020
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:47.270 --> 02:54.020
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:56.780 --> 02:59.030
<b>Art Room</b>

03:03.280 --> 03:05.920
Mona-chan's looking lovely as ever.

03:05.920 --> 03:08.610
Yeah, she's the cutest.

03:08.610 --> 03:09.750
An angel.

03:10.460 --> 03:13.680
So, how's this pose, Kuroiwa-kun?

03:17.810 --> 03:20.380
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit.</i>

03:23.330 --> 03:28.390
<i>Medaka Kuroiwa! Why's he, and he alone, 
always givin' me the stink-eye?!</i>

03:28.930 --> 03:30.770
Something more normal, please.

03:30.770 --> 03:33.940
Come on, don't be shy.

03:33.940 --> 03:36.860
It's not often I get the chance to model.

03:36.860 --> 03:40.400
I'll do anything! Just say the word.

03:41.010 --> 03:43.410
D-Did she say "anything"?!

03:43.410 --> 03:45.620
Oh, but...

03:46.320 --> 03:49.080
Nude is off-limits, you bad boy.

03:50.280 --> 03:51.850
Just kidding.

03:52.340 --> 03:54.040
Duh.

03:54.350 --> 03:57.050
<i>I-It was a joke, you doofus!</i>

03:57.050 --> 03:58.610
It's okay, Mona-chan!

03:58.610 --> 04:00.590
We found it funny!

04:03.250 --> 04:06.160
<i>Today's the last day 
you give me that stink-eye.</i>

04:06.160 --> 04:11.560
<i>After all, this art assignment requires 
seat neighbors to draw each other.</i>

04:12.310 --> 04:14.220
<i>I gotcha right where I want ya!</i>

04:14.220 --> 04:17.380
<i>I'm gonna toast to my victory tonight 
with barley tea!</i>

04:17.770 --> 04:20.480
<i>Now, what pose should I strike?</i>

04:25.970 --> 04:29.450
<i>He was gawkin' at me that day.</i>

04:30.550 --> 04:32.300
<i>I choose you!</i>

04:33.710 --> 04:36.880
<i>She's... She's as pretty as ever today!</i>

04:37.540 --> 04:40.450
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit.</i>

04:40.450 --> 04:42.720
<i>I have to uphold the tenets!</i>

04:43.340 --> 04:45.240
Kuroiwa-kun, Kuroiwa-kun!

04:47.180 --> 04:48.740
How about this?

04:49.930 --> 04:51.410
Cute!

04:51.410 --> 04:53.390
That's lovely, Mona-chan.

04:54.350 --> 04:56.560
It's like I'm a model.

04:57.500 --> 05:00.820
<i>Yes! He's beet red!</i>

05:03.570 --> 05:05.530
<i>H... H...</i>

05:06.090 --> 05:08.160
<i>Hang in there, buddy!</i>

05:08.160 --> 05:10.830
<i>This assignment is part of my training!</i>

05:11.710 --> 05:13.320
Whatever. That'll do.

05:21.420 --> 05:24.890
<i>Aw, that didn't work either.</i>

05:24.890 --> 05:27.910
<i>How can he not even flinch 
at such a beauty modelin' for him?</i>

05:35.930 --> 05:39.400
<i>Look at him, drawin' like he's the Moz of Art!</i>

05:41.650 --> 05:44.260
Uh, <i>I'm</i> your model, remember?

05:44.260 --> 05:46.740
Oh, s-sorry about that!

06:00.620 --> 06:03.360
<i>S-Starin' a bit too much, don'tcha think?</i>

06:13.350 --> 06:17.430
<i>Why's that girl keep lookin' over here?</i>

06:18.100 --> 06:20.650
Wh-What part are you on right now?

06:21.800 --> 06:22.860
Your neck.

06:25.080 --> 06:26.530
<i>So slender.</i>

06:28.180 --> 06:32.200
<i>Urk, so he's looking at my neck right now?</i>

06:36.550 --> 06:41.460
<i>The idea that he's staring 
intently at my neck...</i>

06:42.110 --> 06:44.430
<i>It's getting me hot!</i>

06:48.990 --> 06:50.590
<i>His gaze...</i>

06:54.060 --> 06:55.800
<i>It's burning a hole in me!</i>

07:04.090 --> 07:06.190
<i>Y-You numpty!</i>

07:06.190 --> 07:08.690
O-Okay, that's that!

07:08.690 --> 07:09.530
Huh?

07:09.900 --> 07:12.410
I don't feel so good, so I'm gonna bounce!

07:12.410 --> 07:14.370
M-Mona-chan?!

07:19.450 --> 07:21.030
Kuroiwa-kun?

07:30.760 --> 07:37.290
He kept looking away whenever 
I sweet-talked him or whatever,

07:37.290 --> 07:38.930
but now he decides to stare?

07:41.630 --> 07:45.480
No fair. You should be looking at me 
like that every single time!

07:45.900 --> 07:48.400
<b>Art Room</b>

07:51.080 --> 07:52.760
Oho?

07:53.470 --> 07:55.130
Whatcha gonna do with that portrait?

07:55.130 --> 07:57.240
You did well to keep your eyes 
on her to draw it.

07:57.240 --> 07:59.120
I-It's not like that...

08:02.340 --> 08:11.670
Clear mind, clear spirit!

08:09.160 --> 08:10.750
I feel for him.

08:10.750 --> 08:11.670
Right?

08:11.670 --> 08:14.130
<b>Library</b>

08:17.740 --> 08:21.060
<i>Wherever there are books,</i>

08:22.100 --> 08:27.060
<i>there's a chance for romance!</i>

08:27.360 --> 08:30.620
You're here to look up stuff 
for our assignment too?

08:30.620 --> 08:34.420
What are the odds we'd both pick 
the same book out of all these?

08:34.420 --> 08:36.160
It must be fate.

08:37.530 --> 08:39.300
Would you like to read it toge—

08:39.300 --> 08:40.290
You can have it.

08:44.960 --> 08:48.610
<i>Gah, she's so cute! And her hand was so soft!</i>

08:48.610 --> 08:50.460
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

08:50.950 --> 08:54.430
<i>Hmph, what else's new? 
I'm in this for the long haul.</i>

08:54.430 --> 08:57.080
<i>No need to be rushin' things.</i>

09:01.550 --> 09:03.030
Haruno-san?

09:03.350 --> 09:05.560
<b></b>This week's recommendations!

09:03.350 --> 09:05.560
<b></b>Silence in the library.

09:03.350 --> 09:05.560
<b></b>Books Are Seeds for the Soul

09:07.410 --> 09:10.270
I hate him! Why can't that be me?

09:10.670 --> 09:13.490
Can I turn the page, Kuroiwa-kun?

09:13.490 --> 09:16.550
I'll find something else to read.

09:16.550 --> 09:17.950
What?

09:19.880 --> 09:23.160
<i>Uh, if she needs something from me, 
why doesn't she just come over?</i>

09:23.160 --> 09:24.940
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

09:24.940 --> 09:27.240
<i>Why's she keep starin' at me?</i>

09:27.240 --> 09:29.750
<i>It was the same back in the art room...</i>

09:32.570 --> 09:34.170
<i>Wait, is it not me?</i>

09:36.290 --> 09:38.520
<i>Is she starin' at him?!</i>

09:38.890 --> 09:40.280
<i>Why?</i>

09:40.280 --> 09:42.020
<i>Does Haruno-san...</i>

09:42.020 --> 09:44.350
<i>have a thing for Medaka?!</i>

09:44.350 --> 09:47.810
<i>N-No way... There's a girl out there 
with a crush on him?</i>

09:47.810 --> 09:50.310
Hngh! Hngh!

09:50.660 --> 09:55.440
<i>Wh-What if Medaka's into 
girls like Haruno-san?</i>

09:59.380 --> 10:01.410
<i>Not good!</i>

10:01.680 --> 10:03.890
<i>Nope, nope! Not happenin'!</i>

10:03.890 --> 10:06.500
<i>I'm the one puttin' the moves on him here!</i>

10:06.500 --> 10:10.130
<i>Yikes. I don't have the time 
to take it slow and steady.</i>

10:10.130 --> 10:13.710
<i>This guy's nowhere near 
even givin' me the time of day.</i>

10:13.710 --> 10:15.940
<i>I gotta pull out all the stops.</i>

10:15.940 --> 10:18.280
<i>Haruno-san is the quiet, bookworm type.</i>

10:18.280 --> 10:20.800
<i>If that's what Medaka's into...</i>

10:21.340 --> 10:25.580
<i>I'll show him by unlockin' my true potential!</i>

10:37.870 --> 10:39.030
What's the matter?

10:41.950 --> 10:44.140
Mona-chan in glasses!

10:44.140 --> 10:46.950
Eating and drinking aren't
 allowed here, but she's so cute.

10:48.060 --> 10:50.760
<i>Readin' goes hand-in-hand 
with glasses and tea.</i>

10:52.590 --> 10:55.150
<i>How d'you like my literature girl?</i>

10:55.150 --> 10:58.300
<i>Doesn't this brand-new side of me 
make your heart race?</i>

10:58.790 --> 11:03.680
<i>Wh-When did she get in front of me? 
And she looks great in glasses!</i>

11:04.660 --> 11:06.970
<i>Just pick me, Medaka.</i>

11:07.870 --> 11:10.350
<i>If you do,</i>

11:10.350 --> 11:12.480
<i>I'll excite you in new ways every day!</i>

11:12.980 --> 11:16.190
<i>Now for some suggestive footsies.</i>

11:16.570 --> 11:19.310
<i>Wh-What the? What's she playing at?</i>

11:20.130 --> 11:22.490
<i>Submit to my charms already!</i>

11:22.840 --> 11:25.700
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

11:26.030 --> 11:28.970
<i>I ain't lettin' another girl take you 
after all I've done!</i>

11:30.890 --> 11:35.090
Say, what do you think about me?

11:36.660 --> 11:39.050
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

11:39.370 --> 11:41.310
Your leg's hitting me.

11:43.770 --> 11:46.200
I am naught. Naught.

11:46.850 --> 11:49.220
<b></b>shock

11:47.110 --> 11:50.720
<i>Th-That didn't work either? 
Oh, for the love of...</i>

11:54.310 --> 11:59.360
<i>Sh-She seems pleased! 
She's totally after Medaka!</i>

12:01.020 --> 12:02.660
<i>What now?</i>

12:03.420 --> 12:05.550
<i>I've got a challenger.</i>

12:05.550 --> 12:07.220
Y-You okay, Mona-chan?

12:07.220 --> 12:08.900
Shall I get you some more tea?

12:13.660 --> 12:16.040
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

12:18.670 --> 12:21.050
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

12:27.290 --> 12:30.980
<i>Tsubomi Haruno, a new challenger 
after Medaka's heart.</i>

12:30.980 --> 12:33.390
<i>What kinda gal is she?</i>

12:33.390 --> 12:36.610
<i>Can't be too special, right?</i>

12:37.110 --> 12:38.700
<i>Right?</i>

12:40.850 --> 12:45.450
<i>She's waterin' the flower bed 
without anyone askin' her to.</i>

12:50.720 --> 12:55.830
<i>During breaks, she either reads or wipes 
the blackboard, even when she's not on duty.</i>

12:56.260 --> 12:58.540
<i>Lines up the desks, too.</i>

12:58.960 --> 13:00.790
<i>Hmm...</i>

13:01.940 --> 13:04.380
<i>She's just a plain ol' good girl!</i>

13:04.380 --> 13:06.640
<b>Girls' Changing Room</b>

13:09.230 --> 13:13.020
<i>Oh, come on. Show me your flaws, girl.</i>

13:13.020 --> 13:17.440
<i>Lemme write you off as bein' unable to 
capture Medaka's heart so I can chill out!</i>

13:19.440 --> 13:22.360
<b>doom</b>

13:20.280 --> 13:22.360
<i>Perfectly shaped boobies!</i>

13:22.700 --> 13:25.420
Y'know, Tsubomi, you low-key 
have an awesome body.

13:25.420 --> 13:27.280
Huh? N-No way.

13:27.280 --> 13:30.160
You do. I'm envious.

13:30.530 --> 13:32.930
Be more confident.

13:32.930 --> 13:34.320
Come on.

13:34.320 --> 13:37.080
I have a hard enough time 
even when it's girls looking at me.

13:37.330 --> 13:39.460
<b>Super Modest</b>

13:37.440 --> 13:39.460
<i>And she's super modest!</i>

13:41.920 --> 13:44.880
<i>She's got everything I don't!</i>

13:48.680 --> 13:52.220
<i>Welp. She's just a nicer, 
sweeter gal than I am.</i>

13:52.220 --> 13:55.940
<i>If Medaka's into the reserved type, I'm toast.</i>

13:55.940 --> 13:59.140
<i>I gotta get the job done, 
or she'll take him from me!</i>

13:59.140 --> 14:00.190
Mona-chan!

14:00.890 --> 14:03.570
I brought you the book we talked about.

14:03.570 --> 14:06.040
For me? No way!

14:06.040 --> 14:07.780
It's great! Trust me.

14:07.780 --> 14:10.840
Thanks! Love you!

14:12.150 --> 14:15.400
That's gonna keep me going 
for the rest of the day!

14:15.400 --> 14:17.550
Let me know what you think when you're done.

14:17.550 --> 14:18.710
Gotcha.

14:18.710 --> 14:20.130
Thanks.

14:20.130 --> 14:21.700
No problem!

14:20.760 --> 14:24.720
Huh? I've never talked to Medaka like this.

14:24.720 --> 14:28.100
Fawning all over him like, 
"Love you, Kuroiwa-kun!"

14:39.940 --> 14:41.150
What a nice breeze.

14:46.020 --> 14:48.320
Oh, I'm in luck.

14:55.010 --> 14:56.870
Thanks for grabbing it for me.

14:58.680 --> 15:03.840
<i>There's not a boy in the world who hasn't 
dreamed of bein' hit on by a hottie like me.</i>

15:04.110 --> 15:06.300
<i>Once I put the idea in 
his head, he'll be mine.</i>

15:06.670 --> 15:11.380
Taking a breather? I often come 
to the roof for a break too.

15:11.700 --> 15:14.330
This hanky's a favorite of mine.

15:14.780 --> 15:18.430
You're always so helpful, Kuroiwa-kun.

15:18.430 --> 15:22.500
It's that side of you that I really...

15:24.310 --> 15:25.240
L...

15:26.670 --> 15:27.610
L...?

15:28.260 --> 15:29.120
<i>Hm?</i>

15:29.820 --> 15:33.530
H-Huh? G-Gimme a sec.

15:33.530 --> 15:38.350
It's that side of you that I really l... l...

15:40.130 --> 15:41.710
<i>Why?</i>

15:41.960 --> 15:45.060
<i>It came out so easy earlier!</i>

15:47.170 --> 15:48.770
<i>So why?!</i>

15:48.770 --> 15:49.920
L...

15:52.810 --> 15:54.340
<i>Seriously, why?!</i>

15:57.730 --> 16:00.820
<i>Why can't I say the word "love" to Medaka?!</i>

16:00.820 --> 16:01.770
L...

16:03.970 --> 16:05.310
Lech.

16:06.350 --> 16:09.220
N-No! I saw nothing!

16:09.220 --> 16:11.650
It's really windy here, so talk to you later!

16:11.650 --> 16:12.530
Huh?

16:14.820 --> 16:15.860
What?

16:21.520 --> 16:23.330
Gah...

16:23.900 --> 16:27.660
I gotta hurry, or I might lose him!

16:30.460 --> 16:32.920
<b>Fes Committee Selection!
(Drawing lots)</b>

16:34.880 --> 16:35.390
<b></b>Out

16:34.880 --> 16:36.820
Phew. I'm safe.

16:38.470 --> 16:39.970
<b></b>Out

16:43.400 --> 16:48.440
<i>It's been a month since Medaka got here, 
and he still shows no signs of fallin' for me.</i>

16:48.760 --> 16:51.650
<i>But why? Look how hot I am.</i>

16:51.780 --> 16:53.110
<b></b>In

16:53.110 --> 16:54.570
<b>Tsubomi</b>

16:54.570 --> 16:58.910
<b>Fes Committee Selection
(Marimo Fes.)</b>

16:54.570 --> 16:58.910
<b>Tsubomi Haruno</b>

16:55.110 --> 16:58.000
We have our first rep, 
and it's Tsubomi Haruno!

16:59.540 --> 17:02.620
<i>And now I got some stiff competition.</i>

17:04.330 --> 17:07.330
<i>I think I'm a little allergic to her.</i>

17:09.290 --> 17:10.750
<b>Mona</b>

17:09.290 --> 17:10.750
<b>Tsubomi</b>

17:11.040 --> 17:14.250
And our second rep is Mona Kawai!

17:14.250 --> 17:15.900
<i>Drama alert!</i>

17:16.540 --> 17:19.680
G-Good to be working with you, Mona-chan.

17:19.680 --> 17:22.100
<b>Mona    Tsubomi</b>

17:20.500 --> 17:22.100
Same here.

17:31.040 --> 17:36.280
A maid cafe, a play, a haunted house...

17:37.660 --> 17:41.740
Mona-chan, what did your class do 
for your middle school festival?

17:42.020 --> 17:44.700
Uh... a costume cafe.

17:44.700 --> 17:47.710
Wow, that sounds fun!

17:48.230 --> 17:51.800
You must've looked adorable 
in a puffy costume.

17:51.800 --> 17:54.430
Not even close.

17:53.920 --> 17:56.800
<b>Costume Cafe</b>

17:56.800 --> 17:58.180
I can't see!

17:58.180 --> 18:00.390
I can't! This ain't happenin'!

18:01.180 --> 18:04.640
<i>Can't be very adorable 
when you cover up your face.</i>

18:07.850 --> 18:13.250
<i>I can't get a read on her. 
We're technically in a love triangle.</i>

18:13.250 --> 18:15.400
<i>Though I'm only in it to capture his heart.</i>

18:15.950 --> 18:18.380
<i>So why's she look so dang happy?</i>

18:18.380 --> 18:20.240
Let's do a class survey tomorrow.

18:20.240 --> 18:21.660
S-Sure.

18:22.420 --> 18:24.870
<i>Does she not even consider me competition?</i>

18:24.870 --> 18:28.900
<i>My queen bee instincts 
are ringin' alarm bells!</i>

18:28.900 --> 18:32.500
<i>Goody-two-shoes are serious 
threats to girls like me!</i>

18:33.380 --> 18:34.260
<i>Tch.</i>

18:36.540 --> 18:38.840
W-Want mine?

18:39.470 --> 18:40.680
Thanks.

18:40.680 --> 18:42.600
<b>beam</b>

18:44.840 --> 18:45.770
Something wrong?

18:45.770 --> 18:48.480
N-Nothing! It's fine!

18:48.480 --> 18:50.980
Yeah? I was just trying to give this back.

18:50.980 --> 18:55.320
No way! You're the last person 
I can let see my phone!

18:56.310 --> 18:57.140
Wha?

18:57.960 --> 19:00.530
<i>I'm the last person who can see?</i>

19:02.030 --> 19:05.540
<i>That just means I totally gotta!</i>

19:06.010 --> 19:08.410
I... I wanna see.

19:09.070 --> 19:11.890
No! Anyone but you!

19:11.890 --> 19:15.280
That just makes me wanna see even more!

19:15.280 --> 19:16.640
No means no!

19:16.640 --> 19:18.380
But why?!

19:18.380 --> 19:19.760
You'll hate me if you see!

19:19.760 --> 19:24.490
Urk... I won't! As long as you 
keep your hands off my Medaka!

19:24.800 --> 19:26.760
<b>slam</b>

19:28.770 --> 19:31.440
Got it. Now, what's in here?

19:33.870 --> 19:35.110
Me?

19:36.740 --> 19:38.070
It's all me?

19:40.070 --> 19:43.780
I'm so sorry! Please don't get creeped out!

19:44.080 --> 19:46.740
Huh? Wait, what?

19:46.740 --> 19:50.960
U-Um, it's okay. I don't hate ya 
for this or anythin'.

19:51.370 --> 19:58.000
I've been your fan ever since 
I saw you at our entrance ceremony.

19:58.610 --> 20:00.390
I just found you so cute.

20:00.900 --> 20:05.570
I thought you shone like the sun 
and put smiles on people's faces.

20:06.200 --> 20:06.990
Huh?

20:06.990 --> 20:13.440
I wanted pics of you so I could look 
at you anytime, so I sneakily took some.

20:13.810 --> 20:18.580
Oh, but don't worry! 
I only have, like, 300 pics of you.

20:20.040 --> 20:23.740
<i>Wait, so Haruno-san 
wasn't looking at Medaka...</i>

20:24.440 --> 20:25.840
<i>but at me?</i>

20:26.440 --> 20:29.020
You're even my lock screen!

20:29.020 --> 20:33.460
I thought about changing it before you saw 
because I figured it'd weird you out,

20:33.850 --> 20:36.920
but that just made you suspicious.

20:37.260 --> 20:39.130
Oh, come here, you!

20:39.750 --> 20:41.180
S-Sorry.

20:41.180 --> 20:44.890
It's fine. A few pics don't bother me.

20:44.890 --> 20:47.100
Y-You're so nice!

20:47.100 --> 20:49.370
<i>And here I thought she wanted Medaka.</i>

20:49.370 --> 20:52.600
<i>Wait, what the heck did I blurt out earlier?</i>

20:52.600 --> 20:54.300
I'm really sorry.

20:54.300 --> 20:56.030
H... Haruno-san.

20:56.810 --> 20:59.190
Well, uh...

20:59.710 --> 21:04.350
Wh-When I told you to keep 
your hands off my Medaka,

21:04.350 --> 21:07.440
I was, uh... I was talking about medaka fish!

21:07.440 --> 21:09.740
Don't get the wrong idea, okay?

21:11.060 --> 21:13.830
Oh, don't worry. I get it.

21:15.580 --> 21:17.710
You meant Kuroiwa-kun, right?

21:18.330 --> 21:20.740
N-No! The fish!

21:20.740 --> 21:22.570
It's okay. I understand.

21:22.570 --> 21:25.760
You've been acting strange 
ever since he transferred in.

21:25.760 --> 21:27.200
The fish, darn it!

21:27.200 --> 21:31.660
And just the other day, when you 
were wearing his gym shirt...

21:32.680 --> 21:35.630
You saw that?! Wait, no!

21:35.630 --> 21:39.520
I was talking about the Japanese rice fish!

21:39.880 --> 21:42.190
Besides, I noticed something.

21:47.690 --> 21:52.140
<i>Mona-chan's got this look that says she sees 
the world in a whole new light now!</i>

21:52.140 --> 21:55.410
<i>She's definitely got a crush on Kuroiwa-kun!</i>

21:55.410 --> 21:58.430
I'll be rooting for you with all my heart.

21:58.430 --> 22:01.370
You've got my support in your quest for love!

22:01.370 --> 22:03.630
Are ya listenin' to a word 
I'm sayin', Haruno-san?!

22:03.630 --> 22:06.060
Thanks for today, Mona-chan.

22:06.060 --> 22:08.410
I think I'm an even bigger fan of yours now.

22:11.530 --> 22:14.380
Listen to me!

23:45.060 --> 23:50.070
<b>Episode 3





School Festival with Him</b>

23:45.060 --> 23:50.070
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

23:47.010 --> 23:49.790
Next time: "School Festival with Him."
